From 43f6cd9b8039600971079d0923f3dac5e6315e53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonico Eustaquio <jonico.eustaquio@fii-na.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Oct 2024 15:03:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Use I2CMux and I2CBus objects to get bus number

Added support for using either "Bus" or the MuxChannel object for all
sensors that use "Bus." When using the MuxChannel object, the "MuxName"
and "ChannelName" properties within the object will be used and
attempted to match with a mux that has the same "Name" and
"ChannelName." The sensors that now support using the MuxChannel object
include fansensors, hwmontempsensors, intelcpusensors, intrusionsensors,
ipmbsensors, mcutempsensors, nvmesensors, and psusensors.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Change-Id: I96189b0f87571057e60fbf76ff359f0bc441c1ac
Signed-off-by: Jonico Eustaquio <jonico.eustaquio@fii-na.com>
